WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.610
Makkah, around 605.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.900
The clans are rebuilding the Ka'bah.

3
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.910
Now the Black Stone must go back in place.

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.900
Every clan wants that honour.

5
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.480
The quarrel grows.

6
00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:16.460
So they turn to a man the whole
city calls al-Amin: the trustworthy.

7
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.130
He grew up an orphan.

8
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:23.460
What kind of city was this, and how did
an orphan become the man it trusted most?

9
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.660
In this mission, you'll
map Arabia before Islam,

10
00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.760
from Yathrib in the north
to Yemen in the south.

11
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:34.570
Then you'll follow his early life, and
see how two scholars read his world.

12
00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.380
Your mission: find out
what Makkah was like,

13
00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.470
and how an orphan won its trust.
